[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14160.189, "timestamp": "03:56:00", "text": "對其他人來說，情況的確如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14164.269, "timestamp": "03:56:04", "text": "起初並非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14169.79, "timestamp": "03:56:09", "text": "說實話，到目前為止我還沒做什麼特別的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14173.99, "timestamp": "03:56:13", "text": "成為救世主的願望最終源自於你自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14177.269, "timestamp": "03:56:17", "text": "那隻不過是仿製品而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14178.99, "timestamp": "03:56:18", "text": "但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14182.95, "timestamp": "03:56:22", "text": "死後，當你擁有太多空閒時間時，你就不會意識到這一點了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14186.63, "timestamp": "03:56:26", "text": "這樣的存在。更多明星"}]